    <string name="family_sub">Parental controls for your family</string>
    <string name="family_intro">With Nova Family parents lock their child\'s phone – right now, until a time or every night (bedtime) – and set a daily screen time. While the phone is locked the child only sees the lock screen: calling the parents and emergency numbers and the torch always work.</string>
